      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17745/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pierce chicken breasts with a fork.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yz9qVCqM3lRPDMOxz8HZ0DOjCYA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-17745-Italian-Chicken-ii-Step-02-94770010a5fe4dc1bffe9c376ad6d58a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17745/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour salad dressing into a large resealable plastic bag; add chicken breasts, seal bag, and shake to coat. Marinate in the refrigerator for at least 1 hour to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vuYYnEeOJLN4HGv8rNqH3nh8zxE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-17745-Italian-Chicken-ii-Step-03-59b6720cb17541b9971eb19967f869ab.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17745/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Remove chicken from marinade and place in a lightly greased 9x13-inch baking dish; discard remaining marinade.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uosf5aG6o0fH_WS-eGvI2WUzt98=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-17745-Italian-Chicken-ii-Step-05-8b43b3241dd4431ea64d7c705d4a60ab.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17745/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven, turning chicken occasionally, until cooked through and juices run clear, about 1 hour. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/auHzVq-HtWnhmWsVAf2EsVcFBek=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-17745-Italian-Chicken-ii-Step-06-9408dfcbe25a4fa1bcb29470bf30643c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17745/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
